# Review routing for the paths where a bad change is expensive. Owned by this repository.
#
# Deliberately NOT a catch-all `*`: a catch-all requests the whole team on every PR, including the
# routine ones that merge into uat without approval, which trains people to ignore review requests.
# A request from this file therefore means something. Teams must have write access to own paths.

# CI, gates and anything that changes what the gates enforce.
/.github/        @axelliantsoftwareteam/eng-standards
/.githooks/      @axelliantsoftwareteam/eng-standards
/scripts/        @axelliantsoftwareteam/eng-standards
/.axelliant/     @axelliantsoftwareteam/eng-standards

